{"id":"d68659d9f4b6927e","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-card6-bounding-family.md","title":"ZFC Card6 Bounding Family","display":"df-zfc-card6-bounding-family — ZFC Card6 Bounding Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-card6-bounding-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-card6-bounding-family"],"display":"df-zfc-card6-bounding-family — ZFC Card6 Bounding Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-card6-bounding-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-card6-bounding-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-card6-bounding-family — ZFC Card6 Bounding Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6BoundingFamily}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6BoundingFamily}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6BoundingFamily}_S(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal B\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land\\forall g\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(n_0\\leq n\\land g(n)&lt;f(n))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6BoundingFamily}_S(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal B\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land\\forall g\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(n_0\\leq n\\land g(n)&lt;f(n))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Here “bounding family” means an unbounded family witnessing the bounding number: no single <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(g\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> eventually dominates every member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6BoundingFamily}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6BoundingFamily}_S(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal B\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land\\forall g\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(n_0\\leq n\\land g(n)<f(n))","display":true},{"tex":"g\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false}],"bytes":918,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1488","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-card6-bounding-family.md|58-df-zfc-card6-bounding-family]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}